B.Sv=s(["My name can be translated as \u2018on the sea\u2019.","The Huangpu River divides my historic centre from a newer financial district.","European-style buildings line an area known as the Bund.","Pudong\u2019s rapid development transformed my skyline.","The Oriental Pearl Tower is one of my landmarks.","I stand near the mouth of the Yangtze River.","I have one of the world\u2019s busiest container ports.","I am one of China\u2019s largest cities and a major financial centre.","My best-known waterfront promenade faces Pudong.","My skyline includes the Shanghai Tower."],t.s)
