B.Qa=s(["I developed beside a natural inlet known as the Creek.","Pearling and maritime trade shaped my early economy.","The Al Fahidi district preserves part of my older architecture.","Artificial islands have been built off my coastline.","An indoor ski slope operates inside one of my shopping centres.","The sail-shaped Burj Al Arab stands near my shore.","I am part of the United Arab Emirates.","I am known for rapid growth and futuristic architecture.","The world\u2019s tallest building stands here.","I am home to the Burj Khalifa."],t.s)
B.JA=new A.bo("Dubai","assets/images/categories/countries/major_cities/countries_major_cities_0007_dubai.webp",B.Qa,B.F)
B.R5=s(["Portuguese explorers named me after mistaking a bay for a river.","I served as the seat of the Portuguese royal court in the early nineteenth century.","Tijuca Forest lies within my urban area.","Sugarloaf Mountain rises beside my harbour.","Copacabana and Ipanema are famous beaches.","My annual Carnival is known around the world.","I hosted the Summer Olympic Games in 2016.","I lie on Brazil\u2019s Atlantic coast.","A giant Art Deco statue overlooks me.","Christ the Redeemer stands above my city."],t.s)
B.Jr=new A.bo("Rio de Janeiro","assets/images/categories/countries/major_cities/countries_major_cities_0008_rio_de_janeiro.webp",B.R5,B.F)
B.SY=s(["My name is commonly translated as \u2018Fragrant Harbour\u2019.","I was administered by Britain for more than 150 years.","I returned to Chinese sovereignty in 1997.","Victoria Harbour separates two major parts of my urban area.","A historic tram climbs to Victoria Peak.","My skyline is backed by steep green hills.","I operate as a special administrative region of China.","My public transport includes the Star Ferry.","I am a major Asian financial centre.","Victoria Harbour is my best-known view."],t.s)
B.JV=new A.bo("Hong Kong","assets/images/categories/countries/major_cities/countries_major_cities_0009_hong_kong.webp",B.SY,B.F)
B.Qw=s(["I grew rapidly during the Industrial Revolution.","The world\u2019s first inter-city passenger railway connected me with Liverpool.","My canals and warehouses reflect my industrial past.","I became closely associated with cotton manufacturing.","A worker bee is one of my civic symbols.","The Ha\xe7ienda nightclub influenced my modern music history.","Two globally famous football clubs carry my name.","I am located in north-west England.","Old Trafford and the Etihad Stadium are nearby sporting landmarks.","I am the English city associated with Manchester United and Manchester City."],t.s)
B.Jm=new A.bo("Manchester","assets/images/categories/countries/major_cities/countries_major_cities_0010_manchester.webp",B.Qw,B.F)
B.rU=s([B.Jp,B.JE,B.Js,B.JS,B.Ji,B.Jt,B.JA,B.Jr,B.JV,B.Jm],t.pa)
